{"path":"utility/optional/value","title":"std::optional<T>::value","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::optional&lt;T&gt;::</span>value","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/optional/value","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"If *this contains a value, returns a reference to the contained value.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> contains a value, returns a reference to the contained value.\n</p><p>Otherwise, throws a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/bad_optional_access\">std::bad_optional_access</a></span> exception.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A reference to the contained value.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/bad_optional_access\">std::bad_optional_access</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> does not contain a value.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The dereference operator <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/operator*\">operator*()</a></span> does not check if this optional contains a value, which may be more efficient than <code>value()</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;optional&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional\"><span class=\"kw1082\">std::<span class=\"me2\">optional</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> opt <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>maybe_unused<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> opt.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/bad_optional_access\"><span class=\"kw1084\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bad_optional_access</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        opt.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/bad_optional_access\"><span class=\"kw1084\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bad_optional_access</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    opt <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">43</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>opt <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    opt.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">44</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> opt.<span class=\"me1\">value</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>bad optional access\nbad optional access\n43\n44</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/value_or\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value_or</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the contained value if available, another value otherwise <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/operator*\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator-&gt;</span><span>operator*</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the contained value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/optional/bad_optional_access\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>bad_optional_access</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  exception indicating checked access to an optional that doesn't contain a value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/optional","title":"std::optional"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::optional<T>::value","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++17. If *this contains a value, returns a reference to the contained value."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A reference to the contained value."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"std::bad_optional_access if *this does not contain a value."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The dereference operator operator*() does not check if this optional contains a value, which may be more efficient than value()."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"value_or","note":"returns the contained value if available, another value otherwise"},{"label":"operator->, operator*","note":"accesses the contained value"},{"label":"bad_optional_access","note":"exception indicating checked access to an optional that doesn't contain a value"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":190,"codeBlockCount":2}
